            "name": "Amazon Cognito Set Risk Configuration",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Configures actions on detected risks. To delete the risk configuration for <code>UserPoolId</code> or <code>ClientId</code>, pass null values for all four configuration types.</p> <p>To activate Amazon Cognito advanced security features, update the user pool to include the <code>UserPoolAddOns</code> key<code>AdvancedSecurityMode</code>.</p>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
